---
import CheckIcon from '@/assets/icons/CheckIcon.astro';

const { id } = Astro.props;
---

<section
  id={id}
  class="scroll-mt-20 bg-[#111] py-16 lg:py-24 text-white timeline-view animate-blurred-fade-in animate-range-[entry_10%_contain_20%]"
>
  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16"
  >
    <!-- Información -->
    <div class="flex-1 max-w-2xl">

      <span
        class="inline-block rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary"
      >
        Comunidad Fitness
      </span>

      <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold">
        Workout on The Beach
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-2 text-primary font-medium">
        Edición #5 · 23 de marzo de 2025
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-300">
        Un evento diseñado para entrenar, compartir y disfrutar de una
        experiencia diferente al aire libre. Más que un entrenamiento, es una
        oportunidad para conectar con personas que buscan un estilo de vida
        saludable.
      </p>

      <div
        class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900 p-6"
      >
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          ¿Qué incluye?
        </h3>

        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4">

          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <CheckIcon />
            Entrenamiento funcional en la playa.
          </li>

          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <CheckIcon />
            Desayuno saludable.
          </li>

          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <CheckIcon />
            Hidratación durante la jornada.
          </li>

          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <CheckIcon />
            Retos, premios y actividades.
          </li>

        </ul>
      </div>

      <blockquote
        class="mt-8 border-l-4 border-primary pl-5 italic text-gray-200"
      >
        ¿Quieres participar en la próxima edición? Sígueme en mis redes sociales
        y mantente atento a las próximas fechas.
      </blockquote>

    </div>

    <!-- Slider -->
    <div
      class="relative w-full max-w-md aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 shadow-2xl"
    >
      <div id="slider_events" class="absolute inset-0">

        <img src="/images/wotb/1.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 1"/>

        <img src="/images/wotb/2.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 2"/>

        <img src="/images/wotb/3.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 3"/>

        <img src="/images/wotb/4.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 4"/>

        <img src="/images/wotb/5.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 5"/>

        <img src="/images/wotb/6.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 6"/>

        <img src="/images/wotb/7.webp" class="absolute h-full w-full object-cover opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-1000" loading="lazy" alt="Workout on The Beach 7"/>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script type="module">
  const images = document.querySelectorAll('#slider_events img');
  let current = 0;

  function showSlide(index) {
    images.forEach((img, i) => {
      img.style.opacity = i === index ? '1' : '0';
    });
  }

  function nextSlide() {
    current = (current + 1) % images.length;
    showSlide(current);
  }

  showSlide(current);
  setInterval(nextSlide, 4000);
</script>